source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: An escaped ampersand keeps the reference itself in the alt text, where the reader shows `&#44;` as text; jiro writes an alt that holds a reference back the same way.
-- input.jira --
!http://x/i.png|alt=a&#38;#44;b!
-- rendered.html --
<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="http://x/i.png" alt="a&#38;#44;b" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
-- want.md --
![a&amp;#44;b](http://x/i.png)
-- warnings.json --
[]
